        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "HVAC Systems - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The engineering challenge spans three coupled subsystems: thermal (heat transfer, refrigeration cycles), fluid (airflow and duct network design), and control (BAS hierarchy, PID loops, economizer logic). Datacenter cooling is a major application domain — hyperscale facilities (Azure, AWS, Google) are designed around maximizing economizer hours and achieving PUE (Power Usage Effectiveness) of 1.1–1.2."
    }
